Mixed-license repository
========================

This repository combines two layers with different terms.

----------------------------------------------------------------
1. SCRIPTURES — `scriptures/**/*.md`
----------------------------------------------------------------

The Markdown files under `scriptures/` are dedicated to the public domain
under the **Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal — Public Domain Dedication**:

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The author waives copyright and related rights to these files to the extent
possible under law. You may copy, modify, distribute and perform the work,
even for commercial purposes, all without asking permission.

This dedication is consistent with the underlying source editions: the
classical translators (Kumārajīva, Xuanzang, Tibetan translation teams,
etc.) died more than a millennium ago, putting their work well beyond any
copyright term in any jurisdiction. Modern foreign translations bundled
here are either anonymous traditional liturgical transliterations, or
translations from authors and editions whose protection terms have likewise
expired, or AI-assisted translations whose output layer is not claimed
under copyright.

----------------------------------------------------------------
2. WEBSITE — everything else (HTML, CSS, images, icons)
----------------------------------------------------------------

The remaining files in this repository — the landing page (`index.html`,
`privacy.html`, `terms.html`, `styles.css`), the app icon and promotional
posters under `icons/` and `posters/` — are © 2026 Rushi. All rights
reserved.

If you wish to reuse them (for translation, derivative works, study), please
open a GitHub issue or contact zikedece@proton.me.
